# [[help]], [[kindness]], [[benefit]], [[favour]]
#: {{syn|ta|நன்மை}}
#* {{quote-book|ta|year=c. 300 {{BCE}}–500 {{CE}}|author={{w|Tiruvalluvar}}|title={{w|Tirukkural}}|chapter=Gratitude|section_plain=Kural 108|url=https://www.thirukkural.net/en/kural/kural-0108.html|text='''நன்றி''' [[மறப்பது]] [[நன்று|நன்ற]][[அன்று|ன்று]] [[நன்று|நன்ற]][[அல்லது|ல்லது]]<br>[[அன்று|அன்]][[-ஏ|றே]] [[மறப்பது]] [[நன்று]].|t=To forget a '''good turn''' is not good, and good it is<br>To forget at once what isn't good.|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20260605133550/https://www.thirukkural.net/en/kural/kural-0108.html|archivedate=5 June 2026}}
# [[gratitude]], [[gratefulness]]
#: {{syn|ta|செய்ந்நன்றி}}

====Declension====
{{ta-decl}}

